{
 "_comment": "Repo-committed earnings seed, used ONLY by builds with no local market-data-brain earnings cache - i.e. the GitHub Actions daily build, which otherwise reports earnings:0 and silently runs Z-Score with its pre-earnings exit rule INERT. The Mac's brain feed always wins where it has a date; this is a floor, never an override.",
 "_source": "Robinhood earnings calendar (market-data call), four 31-day windows spanning 2026-08-11..2026-11-11, deduped, then intersected with the book universe (TRACK + SCAN + BOOKS.per_name + BOOKSIG + SIGNALS + the ROBERT feed). Past dates are dropped: the only rule that reads this looks one session ahead, so a past date is dead weight that inflates the symbol count.",
